irrigation.</p><p>For civil and industrial applications.</p><p>For fire fighting applications.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231546217621419.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch irrigation submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/submersible-screw-pump/4-stainless-steel-screw-pump\"><img alt=\"4'' Stainless Steel Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/stainless-steel-screw-pump24455672512a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/submersible-screw-pump/4-stainless-steel-screw-pump\">4'' Stainless Steel Screw Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-inch-submersible-pump43410530621a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-pump\">3 Inch Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch/water-cool-motor-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Water Cool Motor Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/water-cool-motor-submersible-pump59510518696a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch/water-cool-motor-submersible-pump\">Water Cool Motor Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/stainless-steel-impeller-submersible-pump/4-stainless-steel-submersible-pump/submersible-shallow-well-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Shallow Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-shallow-well-pump22266774690a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/stainle